  "solution": {
    "text": "The image of object at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math> will be formed at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>. So the object and image will coincide at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>.<br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0093_ea09e3e974f4.png\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Length of image <math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>&nbsp;"
  }
